# size 3 8 35
# ironhold/ward: the north ward of the Siege: a short wall from the gate wall's north end to the river bank.
# Local coordinates from the minimum corner; y 0 is the ground layer. Cells no line sets are structure void and keep the ground.
# A Siege-only wall in the curtains' stone: three thick (x 0..2), six high with a merlon course at y 7 on both faces (odd z open), deepslate pilasters every eight cells and at both ends, no gap anywhere along z 0..34.
# It is placed turned a quarter so it runs east-west; either face may be the outside.

